{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A cozy game about packing bags</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack, sort, and squeeze everyday objects into oddly shaped spaces just the way you like with physics, jiggling, and the satisfaction of fitting things neatly into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/623c79ee0e39f66e8c6444fb5b5beea2.poster.avif?t=1768707705\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/623c79ee0e39f66e8c6444fb5b5beea2.webm?t=1768707705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/623c79ee0e39f66e8c6444fb5b5beea2.mp4?t=1768707705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Odd items, bags, and personalities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balls are bouncy, balloons are floaty, and magic lamps are hard to catch! Some bags twist, some have holes, some aren't bags at all! Piece together the person behind every bag through the things they carry.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pack with friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or cozy up with friends! Supports up to 4 players in local co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/be45cefeab7551db81387fe00560290d.poster.avif?t=1768707705\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/be45cefeab7551db81387fe00560290d.webm?t=1768707705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/be45cefeab7551db81387fe00560290d.mp4?t=1768707705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock and customize pointers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete special tasks as you pack to earn playful  pointers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn new words in another language</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a second language to learn the names of items you pack. Could come in handy for that next trip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/2936849aac5b2ef38b6c47b2764c4916.poster.avif?t=1768707705\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/2936849aac5b2ef38b6c47b2764c4916.webm?t=1768707705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/2936849aac5b2ef38b6c47b2764c4916.mp4?t=1768707705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack your way, with no single correct solution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven puzzles with a few surprise mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxed, no-pressure experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 to 4 players local co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn fun pointers for completing special tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional dual-language item names</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for puzzle fans, travellers, and anyone who loves the satisfaction of fitting things neatly into place.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017680?t=1768707705","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/437ecd43a6b6b00c770ac6bf4a5fb3c2ccbd82b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768707705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/5d3d8a1b967f8c08c0e29f601323e183662dd18b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768707705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/5d3d8a1b967f8c08c0e29f601323e183662dd18b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768707705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A cozy game about packing bags</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack, sort, and squeeze everyday objects into oddly shaped spaces just the way you like with physics, jiggling, and the satisfaction of fitting things neatly into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/623c79ee0e39f66e8c6444fb5b5beea2.poster.avif?t=1768707705\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/623c79ee0e39f66e8c6444fb5b5beea