17680/extras/2936849aac5b2ef38b6c47b2764c4916.poster.avif?t=1768707705\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/2936849aac5b2ef38b6c47b2764c4916.webm?t=1768707705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/extras/2936849aac5b2ef38b6c47b2764c4916.mp4?t=1768707705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack your way, with no single correct solution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven puzzles with a few surprise mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxed, no-pressure experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 to 4 players local co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn fun pointers for completing special tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional dual-language item names</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great for puzzle fans, travellers, and anyone who loves the satisfaction of fitting things neatly into place.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cookiecrayon"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017680/009b23376b1a94fc1326e7f3673cb365c5fb5a2b/header.jpg?t=1768707705","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br><